Attribution notice (provenance, per the zero-rewrite principle):
The certification core reproduces CITE (Ota, Iwase, Ichihara, Komiyama &
Imaizumi, arXiv:2605.05873); the e-process primitives follow Ramdas et al.
(arXiv:2209.11119); the p-to-e calibrator is Vovk & Wang (2021); the conformal
p-value construction is Vovk, Gammerman & Shafer (2005).  Only the composition
(VCE, AVBA, and the CITE x VCE combination) is original to this repository.

Author: 晨星 (CJX0712)
